[claude:event result] {"duration_api_ms":76873,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"cf806938-234a-46b6-a2d5-b2225cc536f5","total_cost_usd":0.07401585,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11431,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":11165,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":10250},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11431},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":752,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10488,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10488,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001253,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":11165,"cacheReadInputTokens":26321,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11431,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.07276285,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":10250,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":2,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Done! The regex has been saved to `/app/regex.txt`.\n\n**How the pattern works:**\n\n1. **IPv4 lookahead** `(?=.*\\b<ipv4>\\b)` — Uses a positive lookahead to ensure an IPv4 address (with word boundaries) exists on the line without consuming it\n\n2. **Greedy matching** `.*` — Matches everything up to the last date on the line (greedy means it reaches the furthest possible point)\n\n3. **Date capture** `\\b([0-9]{4}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01]))\\b` — Captures the date in parentheses:\n   - Year: `[0-9]{4}`\n   - Month: `(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])` (01-12)\n   - Day: `(?:0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01])` (01-31, including Feb 29)\n   - Word boundaries prevent partial matches\n\n4. **IPv4 octet pattern** `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9]?[0-9])` — Matches 0-255 without leading zeros:\n   - 250-255, 200-249, 100-199, 0-99\n\n5. **Negative lookahead** `(?!.*\\bDATE\\b)` — Ensures this is the last date on the line\n\nWith `re.MULTILINE`, the `.` doesn't match newlines, so matching stays within single lines. `re.findall()` returns only the captured date group.","ttft_ms":70329,"type":"result","duration_ms":76158,"uuid":"0cefd73f-9cdf-4bbd-aa70-60aca05b7d4e","ttft_stream_ms":683,"time_to_request_ms":80,"queued_turn_count":0}
